## Set up custom pathing

If you want to use `$ts/file.svelte` instead of `../../ts/file.svelte`

```js
const config = {
	kit: {
		alias: {
			"$ts": "./src/ts"
		}
	}
};
```

## Usage:

```js
import Button from '$ts/Button.svelte';
```